{"product_id":"the-ashes-of-london","title":"The Ashes of London","description":"\u003cp\u003eFrom the No.1 bestselling author of The American Boy and The Silent Boy comes a brand new historical thriller set during the time of the Great Fire of London. The first of an exciting new series of novels.A CITY IN FLAMESLondon, 1666. As the Great Fire consumes everything in its path, the body of a man is found in the ruins of St Paul’s Cathedral – stabbed in the neck, thumbs tied behind his back.A WOMAN ON THE RUNThe son of a traitor, James Marwood is forced to hunt the killer through the city’s devastated streets. There he encounters a determined young woman who will stop at nothing to secure her freedom.A KILLER SEEKING REVENGEWhen a second murder victim is discovered in the Fleet Ditch, Marwood is drawn into the political and religious intrigue of Westminster – and across the path of a killer with nothing to lose…\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 129 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Andrew Taylor\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780008119096\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 496\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45795803955353,"sku":"17RA-39780008119096","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68ef5e23f1fe3_The_Ashes_of_London_Andrew_Taylor.jpg?v=1760541778","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-ashes-of-london","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}